:: Wolf Halloween Fight Finish
<<effects>>
<<speechresolve>>

<<if $enemyhealth lte 0>>
	<<beastwound>>
		<<if $combatTrain.length gt 0>>
		The <<beasttype>> recoils in pain and fear, but another immediately crowds forward, eager for a turn.
		<<combatTrainAdvance>>
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Next|Wolf Halloween Fight]]>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		The <<beasttype>> recoils in pain and fear.
		<<combatTrainAdvance>>
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Next|Wolf Halloween Fight Finish]]>><<set $finish to 1>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<<elseif $enemypleasure gte $enemypleasuremax>>
	<<beastejaculation>>
	<<if $combatTrain.length gt 0>>
		Satisfied, the <<beasttype>> moves aside and another pushes in to take its turn.
		<<wolfpacktrust>>
		<<combatTrainAdvance>>
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Next|Wolf Halloween Fight]]>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		Satisfied, the <<beasttype>> finally backs away from you.<<wolfpacktrust>>
		<<combatTrainAdvance>>
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Next|Wolf Halloween Fight Finish]]>><<set $finish to 1>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<if $enemywounded gt $enemyejaculated>>
		<<famegood 10>>
		You stand triumphantly over the defeated <<wolf_cave_plural>>. They recover shortly after. They keep their distance, now seemingly less eager to provoke you.
		<br><br>

		<<endevent>>
		<<loadNPC 0 "halloween_lake">>

		<<tearful>> you approach the sobbing students. The <<person1>><<person>> flinches at your touch, but you manage to help <<him>> to <<his>> feet and brush the dirt from <<his>> costume.
		<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
			"Oh, it was dumb of you to come here!" you protest. "It's scary and dangerous. Stay in town next time, okay?"
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
			"You really shouldn't have come out here," you say. "Please stay away from this place next time."
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>
			"Well, that was a dreadful little adventure," you say. "Do yourselves a favour and keep to town next time."
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
			"You idiots." You scowl at them. "Don't go doing stupid shit like this again, got it? I won't be around next time."
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
			"Take a good look at yourselves," you say. "Come back here acting stupid again and I might not bother saving you."
		<<else>>
			"Not the brightest move to annoy the pack, was it?" you ask. "Go on, get out of here and don't try it again."
		<</if>>
		<br><br>

		The students scramble to their feet and run away, disappearing behind the trees. You decide it's best to return to the cave for now.
	<<elseif $enemywounded is 0>>
		The <<wolf_cave_plural>> eventually settle, their feverish lust spent. They leave your exhausted body in the grass before padding back toward the cave.
		<br><br>

		<<tearful>> you rise unsteadily to your feet and look around for the students. They must have scrambled off during the commotion. You take a moment to gather yourself before making your way back to the cave.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>><<clearNPC "halloween_lake">>

	<<destinationwolfcave>>
<</if>>